<script setup>
import {computed} from 'vue'
import Icon from './Icon.vue'
import {count,percent,tierLabel,modeLabel} from '../dataModel.js'
import {statisticRuleKey} from '../../utils/statisticsCatalog.js'
const props=defineProps({hierarchy:{type:Array,default:()=>[]},rule:String,error:String})
const rows=computed(()=>props.hierarchy.filter(r=>statisticRuleKey(r)===props.rule||(!r.sub_rule&&r.rule===props.rule)))
const total=computed(()=>rows.value.reduce((s,r)=>s+Number(r.total_games||0),0))
</script>
<template><div class="analysis-view"><section class="analysis-intro panel"><div><span class="eyebrow">RECORD LAB / 牌谱分析</span><h2>完整牌谱分析</h2><p>公开汇总适合观察整体。立直时机、听牌巡目等细节，需要完整牌谱和本地分析结果。</p><a class="primary-button" href="/player-data/analysis" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开已有牌谱分析 <Icon name="external" :size="16"/></a><span class="subtle">在新页面继续；下载完整牌谱需要登录。</span></div><div class="analysis-steps"><div><b>01</b><span><strong>选择玩家与范围</strong><small>使用原有登录和查询入口</small></span></div><div><b>02</b><span><strong>载入完整牌谱</strong><small>沿用现有缓存与下载配额</small></span></div><div><b>03</b><span><strong>查看局内细节</strong><small>按规则计算支持的分析项目</small></span></div></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>统计资料覆盖</h2><span class="subtle">按规则、类型与模式分组 · 独立资料索引</span></div><strong>{{count(total)}} 场</strong></div><p v-if="error" class="inline-empty error-state">{{error}}</p><div v-else-if="!rows.length" class="inline-empty">该规则暂无资料索引</div><div v-else class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>对局类型</th><th>模式 / 场次</th><th class="numeric">对局数</th><th class="numeric">玩家参赛样本</th><th class="numeric">已分析样本</th><th>明细覆盖</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(row,i) in rows" :key="i"><td>{{row.room_type==='match'?'匹配场':row.room_type==='custom'?'自定义':row.room_type==='events'?'比赛 / 基地':row.room_type}}</td><td>{{row.game_type_label||modeLabel(row.mode)}}<small class="block subtle">{{row.match_tier?tierLabel(row.match_tier):''}}</small></td><td class="numeric">{{count(row.total_games)}}</td><td class="numeric">{{count(row.player_game_count)}}</td><td class="numeric">{{count(row.analyzed_player_games)}}</td><td><span class="coverage-bar"><i :style="{width:row.player_game_count>0?Math.min(100,(row.analyzed_player_games||0)/row.player_game_count*100)+'%':'0%'}"/></span>{{row.player_game_count>0?percent(row.analyzed_player_games,row.player_game_count):'未统计'}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="panel-footnote">资料索引与平台累计汇总采集方式不同，不能直接相加。缺失指标显示为「—」，不按零处理。</p></section><div class="analysis-notes"><div><h3>公开可查看</h3><p>累计对局、场次分布、公开玩家的基础统计、番种出现频次与牌谱摘要。</p></div><div><h3>完整牌谱支持</h3><p>已有分析页面按规则计算更多局内指标。当前设计保留该入口，不伪造公开接口尚未提供的数据。</p></div><div><h3>后续可接入</h3><p>如需跨时间段比较、听牌效率或长期趋势，先补充相应服务端统计，再接入当前图表与详情区域。</p></div></div></div></template>
